@startuml cu34
!theme plain
title CU34 — Modificar concepto

actor "Escribano" as Actor
participant "Notaire system" as System

Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) decides to modify a concept.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Presents the list of available concepts.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) selects one of them.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Presents: (Name; Amount; Percentage; Whether the amount is fixed or variable)
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) modifies the necessary data.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Saves the modified concept.
System -> System : System

@enduml